                    text="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;>&lt;b>&lt;u>Instructions&lt;/u>&lt;/b>&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xa;&lt;li>Payroll Services will update your leave balance via Absence Management when your donation has been used.&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>Under the provisions of the Catastrophic Leave Donation Program, each employee may donate their leave credits. The maximum donations are set by the collective bargaining agreement the donor falls under. Leave credits are not considered donated until transfer by Payroll. Payroll will monitor the actual number of hours transferred to ensure that the maximum is not exceeded. The maximums are set by fiscal year.&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xa;&lt;p>&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Following are the maximums by collective bargaining:&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b>Donor Category &amp;amp; Maximum&amp;nbsp; Donation Hours&lt;/b>&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Unit 1 Union of American Physicians-16&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Units 2, 5, 7, 9 (CSUEU)-40&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Unit 3 California Faculty Association (CFA)- 40&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Unit 4 Academic Professionals of California- 40&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Unit 6 State Employees Trades Council (SETC)- 40&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Unit 8 Statewide University Police Association (SUPA)- 40&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Unit 10 International Union of Operating Engineers- 40&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Unit 11 Academic Student Employees (TA's only)- 16&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Confidentials (C99)- 40&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Management Personnel Plan (M80)- 40&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Executive (M98)- 40&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xa;"
